{"resourceIdentifier":"3006","resourceName":"Taiqian County MSW Landfill Site LFG Comprehensive Utilization Project","description":"Taiqian County MSW Landfill Site LFG Comprehensive Utilization Project (hereafter referred to as the project) is located at Taiqian County MSW landfill site (hereafter referred to as Taiqian landfill site), in Taiqian County, Puyang City, Henan Province, P.R. China. The project is constructed and operated by Taiqian County BCCY New Energy Co., Ltd.\r\nTaiqian landfill site started collecting and handling waste at the end of 2019.\r\nThe project started to construct on 01/05/2021. The project has a total designed capacity 1.5MW (3*0.5MW) and combusts the LFG, which contains nearly 50% of methane, to generate electricity and export it to the Central China Power Grid (CCPG). Total electricity supplied to the grid in the crediting period will be 72,333MWh. VCUs will be claimed from the methane destroyed and the grid electricity displaced. The estimated average GHG emission reductions of the project is 43,296tCO2e and the total GHG emission reductions and removals are 432,960tCO2e during the fixed 10 years crediting period.\r\nScenario existing prior to the implementation of the project (the same as baseline scenario):\r\nLFG from Taiqian landfill site is emitted to the atmosphere directly.\r\nEquivalent electricity generated by the project is supplied by the CCPG, which is dominated by fossil fuel based power plants.","location":{"latitude":35.950000,"longitude":115.730000},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-05-17","endExclusive":"2022-06-17","endInclusive":"2022-06-16"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3006"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan BCCY Environmental Energy CO.,LTD."},{"type":"string","value":"Henan, China"},{"type":"string","value":"86 371 6552 1782"},{"type":"string","value":"lwang@bccynewpower.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"3006"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"43296"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-I.D.,AMS-III.G."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"LGAI Technological Center, S.A. (Applus+ Certification)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"27/12/2022"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 31/07/2021 - 30/07/2031"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=63190&IDKEY=s097809fdslkjf09rndasfufd098asodfjlkduf09nm23mrn87s87139010","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Project-Description-Taiqian.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-03-11T05:42:44.757Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=63191&IDKEY=d0e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjfla9n87140389","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"VCS-Listing-Representation-Single-Representor-Taiqian.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-03-11T05:44:10.07Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=81664&IDKEY=m903q4jsafkasjfu90amnmasdfkaidflnmdf9348r09dmfasdff112614656","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Project-Description-Taiqian-Clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-12-27T14:08:38.07Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_